=== T27F Balanced Ternary Float Demo ===

100 = mantissa 100 × 3^0
27  = mantissa 1 × 3^3

--- Property: Exact negation (trit-flip) ---
  +42 mantissa: 42
  -42 mantissa: -42
  neg(neg(42)): 42

--- Property: Single zero ---
  ZERO is zero: true
  0×3^5 normalized is zero: true

--- Property: No NaN ---
  Every 27-trit pattern is a valid T27F number.
  No special bit patterns, no NaN, no infinity.

--- Arithmetic ---
  100 + 200 = 159432300 × 3^-12
  200 - 100 = 159432300 × 3^-13
  3 × 9     = 129140163 × 3^-14

--- Comparison ---
  200 > 100: +
  100 < 200: -
  100 = 100: 0

=== T27F demo complete ===
